  "description": "The instruction of 24 June 1970 governing the revision of particular calendars and propers under the reformed General Roman Calendar. It fixes what belongs to a national, diocesan, religious, local and church calendar, the grades to be assigned, the proper day of a celebration, patrons and titles, and the treatment of solemnities whose festive precept has been removed.",
